{#- The build card, as a host draws it beside `check_job` (design.md §12, "A card in
    someone else's chat", 2026-10-06).

    One document with its style and script inline, handed over whole as the resource
    `ui://targum/build-card.html`: no favicon, no face carried, no link to a sheet. The
    frame fetches nothing, and the only words it starts with are its labels; what it says
    about a build comes in from the tool result (`card.js`).

    No control here starts, confirms or spends anything. The door opens a page of ours. -#}
{% from '_card_head.html.j2' import head %}
<!doctype html>
<html lang="{{ page_language }}">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">
<title>{{ t("card.build.title", "Where a text has got to") }}</title>
<style>{{ asset('card.css') }}</style>
</head>
<body>
<article class="card" id="card" aria-live="polite"
  data-working="{{ t("card.build.working", "Getting it ready") }}"
  data-ready="{{ t("card.build.ready", "Ready to read") }}"
  data-not-ready="{{ t("card.build.not-ready", "Not ready") }}">
  {% call head() %}<span class="card-kind" id="label">{{ t("card.build.working", "Getting it ready") }}</span>{% endcall %}
  <h1 class="card-title" id="title" dir="auto" hidden></h1>
  <p class="card-english" id="english" hidden></p>
  <div class="card-bar" id="bar" role="progressbar" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-labelledby="said" hidden><span id="fill"></span></div>
  <p class="card-said" id="said">{{ t("card.build.looking", "We're looking at where it has got to.") }}</p>
  <p class="card-stopped" id="stopped" hidden>{{ t("card.build.stopped", "We stopped following it here. Ask again to see where it has got to.") }}</p>
  {#- The foot, once there is a door: where the text is kept, and Open (board ConnCards). -#}
  <p class="card-foot" id="foot" hidden><span>{{ t("card.build.kept", "In Your targums") }}</span><a class="card-door" id="door" target="_blank" rel="noopener" hidden>{{ t("card.build.open", "Open") }}<svg class="card-arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6.5 3.5h6v6M12.5 3.5 4 12"></path></svg></a></p>
</article>
<script>{{ asset('card-bridge.js') }}</script>
<script>{{ asset('card.js') }}</script>
</body>
</html>
